  - title: The Printer
    memo: 'MEMO: The big printer in the corner has gone rogue: it''s PRINTING Accounting
      fighters that hunt you, and firing paper at you. While its print job is out
      it''s shielded: shoot the fighters down. Shoot off its paper trays and it prints
      fewer. When it jams, its lid pops open: ride the heat up and shoot the glowing
      fuser inside.'
    mode: 3
    room: 0
    place: 'Office: the printer corner'
    area: 
