  - title: The Auditor
    memo: 'MEMO: Accounting folded a bomber out of a whole ledger and it''s circling
      the break room. Shoot off its wing turrets, dodge its clip bombs, and when
      its engine stalls get on its tail: the glowing engine is the weak spot.'
    mode: 3
