  - title: The Mainframe
    memo: 'MEMO: The Mainframe has joined Accounting. Shoot off its two fans and
      its sweep loses its bite. When it raises a firewall, shoot down its drones.
      When it overheats, ride its hot exhaust up and shoot the hatch.'
    mode: 3
